B.apk=new A.jn("secure-documents","Files in groups","Files in a group open in the protected viewer, marked with the reader\u2019s name.",B.cS,B.bjf,B.bcG)
B.aov=new A.d3("Watermarks","A file someone shares with you has a small grey line at the foot of each page: your name, part of your email, and the time you opened it. A photo that shows the line points back to you. Your own files stay clean; turn on Mark my own screen in Settings if you want them marked too.",!1)
B.aoO=new A.d3("After a capture attempt","If someone tries to print, copy, press PrintScreen or record the screen, their name and email cover the page for the rest of that visit.",!1)
B.aop=new A.d3("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.aoz=new A.d3("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.aRR=s([B.aov,B.aoO,B.aop,B.aoz],t.eH)
