B.aoP=new A.d3('"This link has already been opened"',"A One open link is gone after the first open. Ask for a new one. If you never opened it, assume something else did.",!1)
B.apa=new A.d3('"This invite has expired or been revoked"',"Invite links can expire, have a limit, or be revoked by an admin. Ask for a new one.",!1)
B.aoD=new A.d3("A file will not open","Usually your access was removed or the file was deleted. Pull down to refresh.",!1)
B.aoY=new A.d3("The app says it is offline","Groups, files, your own chat and sending need a connection. Settings \u2192 Connection check shows whether this phone can reach NO SUS.",!1)
